{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"w":0.31893002827962236,"y":0.060954063467692388,"x":0.60493827793417898,"c":1,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","h":0.017667844522968212},{"x":0.08230452193658773,"h":0.020427589281708958,"c":1,"y":0.1074793876394573,"w":0.36419754028320317,"t":"TEST 7, WRITING TASK 2"},{"w":0.20576131184895832,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.082304529157825407,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","y":0.14389534871298137},{"y":0.1802120141191268,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.5 score. Here is the","x":0.082304514085804692,"h":0.016008916255020877,"c":1,"w":0.80452677408854156},{"x":0.082154519323156303,"w":0.20817119598388673,"h":0.016774963855181735,"y":0.19550987667477637,"c":1,"t":"examiner's comment:"},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.23255813938868508,"w":0.74897120157877606,"x":0.12962962542992632,"c":1,"t":"This is a good response which would achieve an even higher score if there was"},{"x":0.12962964076078815,"y":0.24999999983867172,"w":0.75925923665364592,"c":1,"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"more focus on large sums of money and on between cities. The writing is well"},{"w":0.76131688435872391,"h":0.01751034054795475,"t":"organised and there is a clear progression throughout, although the use of some","x":0.12757201028977383,"c":1,"y":0.26737338052921733},{"y":0.28143771423427955,"t":"cohesive devices could be more flexible. There is a wide range of vocabulary,","x":0.12744170349460299,"c":1,"w":0.73493281046549486,"h":0.023863920474642142},{"t":"used appropriately and naturally, [preferred method of transportation | leave the","x":0.12757202040911067,"y":0.30377907015428884,"c":1,"w":0.75102879842122394,"h":0.018953557008848931},{"h":0.017441860778592888,"w":0.76543207804361979,"t":"driving to the professional | more affordable | ever-expanding urban populations |","x":0.12757202658843123,"y":0.32122093006996688,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.12757200568732249,"w":0.79218109130859371,"y":0.34010600698660798,"h":0.015998644317698929,"t":"embrace the idea of], but some spelling errors are noted [Communters | whill | cheif"},{"y":0.35747938766804155,"x":0.12551440160655564,"w":0.78806584676106772,"c":1,"h":0.01752061248527681,"t":"| ammount | busses]. There is a wide range of structures and again, these are used"},{"w":0.56790125528971358,"h":0.01752061248527681,"c":1,"y":0.37499999983989452,"x":0.12551439282243587,"t":"flexibly, however there are occasional errors in punctuation."},{"x":0.082241576451144549,"t":"For many people around the world, the preferred method of transportation is high-speed","h":0.018782766744301349,"y":0.410167244351337,"w":0.81492604573567706,"c":1},{"x":0.07613170027598945,"c":1,"y":0.42873969406975387,"w":0.79218104044596349,"t":"rail. Communters travelling to and from work rely on the safety and efficiency, whill","h":0.018934723906859574},{"x":0.080246914419266874,"y":0.44758539481496995,"h":0.016195524146054074,"w":0.82716049194335939,"t":"tourists appreciate the convenience and novelty that trains provide. Others believe that","c":1},{"x":0.078115988094520694,"t":"highways, busses and regular trains should be improved before new, high-speed lines are","y":0.46385158356147937,"w":0.81906066894531249,"h":0.020542227898946996,"c":1},{"t":"added.","w":0.059701677958170579,"c":1,"h":0.011707274456046579,"x":0.078173852286970019,"y":0.4854254325086963},{"t":"Safety is cheif among concems for those who travel to work or school on a regular","c":1,"h":0.01893958101845461,"w":0.78407719930013009,"x":0.080179274024467784,"y":0.50732852987151011},{"x":0.078131358935499315,"t":"basis. If one drives a car, they have to concentrate on the road not only to avoid","w":0.78199773152669261,"h":0.017336233204188978,"c":1,"y":0.52595655384012052},{"c":1,"w":0.80674906412760417,"t":"accidents but also to prevent other drivers from causing a problem on the road. High-","y":0.54182935127293819,"x":0.080154601888350691,"h":0.020435351224613929},{"y":0.558813958823551,"h":0.021390895821040035,"x":0.08013768987095507,"t":"speed rail allows the communter to leave the driving to the professional controlling the","c":1,"w":0.81298085530598962},{"w":0.70164606730143231,"t":"train, allowing them to get some work done while getting to work safely.","x":0.076131698752259447,"h":0.017667844522968212,"y":0.57979976451748705,"c":1},{"x":0.080136089327354221,"y":0.60335378570693454,"w":0.82530237833658848,"t":"In addition, people tend to move further and further away from city centres, where land","h":0.019896926250839719,"c":1},{"x":0.078119615755850205,"t":"and houses are more affordable. High-speed rail allows these commuters to travel greater","w":0.82729400634765615,"y":0.62130895674843867,"h":0.019888826197252407,"c":1},{"w":0.82932067871093751,"t":"distances in a shorter ammount of time. There is a flow-on effeck here, because if we","x":0.07814524065962454,"y":0.6393188344322378,"c":1,"h":0.016588011113718326},{"w":0.80675959269205721,"h":0.019492815464770108,"y":0.65530277074242738,"t":"can reduce the number of cars on the road, we can also cut down on traffic jams and","x":0.07811398951812161,"c":1},{"w":0.11385012308756509,"c":1,"t":"road delays.","x":0.073841373277542838,"h":0.014535700053292522,"y":0.67805593275836618},{"y":0.70169068398317269,"c":1,"w":0.81493372599283842,"x":0.078122599768093715,"t":"On the other hand, high-speed trains are expensive, and some believe this money could","h":0.017955367219743001},{"y":0.72084805635062377,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"be spend on repairing motorways which are used by cars, busses and motorcycles.","w":0.76543207804361979,"c":1,"x":0.078189310703531301},{"x":0.078137756204473691,"y":0.73689487457781955,"h":0.019319037807001727,"w":0.81696843465169255,"t":"Another possibility would be to use this money to build more regular communter trains","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.078189311307157158,"h":0.017448708362377219,"y":0.75581395332889978,"w":0.81687240600585931,"t":"and busses to service the ever-expanding urban populations. Moreover, boats and ferries"},{"y":0.77325581379357888,"w":0.76131688435872391,"c":1,"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"could benefit from a buaget which focuses more on existing forms of transport.","x":0.078189294340652971},{"w":0.78806584676106761,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"y":0.79941860451821811,"x":0.078189298716055289,"t":"In the end, public transport is an issue which affecks us all. The taxes which we"},{"x":0.073954242838881037,"h":0.021367743663989969,"w":0.78623845418294258,"c":1,"y":0.81445282310849432,"t":"pay should be spent on the type of transport which will have the most benefut to"},{"c":1,"t":"all citizens. In addition, we need to take into account how much the environmenk is","x":0.076131682746421819,"y":0.83568904596066595,"h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.80658437093098956},{"x":0.07604827373908582,"c":1,"t":"damaged by fossil fuels and pollution. therefore, I believe in order to move forward, we","y":0.85020239654077867,"h":0.019435417525759835,"w":0.81290211995442707},{"c":1,"w":0.82941624959309901,"y":0.86814105062580194,"x":0.076031650675840015,"h":0.02118444049597068,"t":"need to embrace the idea of high-speed rail so that future generations can continue to"},{"t":"live safely and efficiently.","y":0.88634617435313734,"h":0.020831566396113388,"w":0.25157010396321611,"c":1,"x":0.073804212088673091},{"y":0.93459302309978554,"w":0.039094651540120373,"x":0.87654320910648309,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"129"},{"w":0.20824633280436194,"y":0.96768258536995222,"h":0.016454192297478354,"x":0.39483721299237268,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org"}]}